  "translation": "Yena a ewela naganeng, tsela ya letšatši, a fihla, a dutše fase ga rothemu se sengwe, a kgopela ⟨את⟩ bophelo bja gagwe go swa lehu, a re: Go lekane bjale, Yahwe, tšea bophelo bja ka, ka gobane ga ⟨ke⟩ botse nna go ditatšu tša ka.",
